{"id":"d39cb806c819f247","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-tarski-vaught.md","title":"Tarski-Vaught Test","display":"thm-tarski-vaught — Tarski-Vaught Test","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-tarski-vaught","aliases":["57-thm-tarski-vaught"],"display":"thm-tarski-vaught — Tarski-Vaught Test","depends_on":["[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-substructure]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-tarski-vaught"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-tarski-vaught</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tarski-vaught — Tarski-Vaught Test"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a7fe4775125052f\" href=\"?note=6a7fe4775125052f\" title=\"57-df-elementary-substructure\">57-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90dc104b21b5c21e\" href=\"?note=90dc104b21b5c21e\" title=\"57-df-substructure\">57-df-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\subseteq\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\subseteq\\mathfrak B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>。参数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[\\vec a/\\vec y]\">\\(\\varphi[\\vec a/\\vec y]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a> 的显式变量列接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq\">\\(\\preccurlyeq\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6a7fe4775125052f\" href=\"?note=6a7fe4775125052f\" title=\"57-df-elementary-substructure\">57-df-elementary-substructure</a>。</p>\n<p>在下式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y=\\langle y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\rangle\">\\(\\vec y=\\langle y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 是有限列拼接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\">\\(\\vec a\\)</span> 长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\preccurlyeq\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\langle x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{n+1}\\;\\left[|\\{x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\}|=n+1\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\left[\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\}\\to\\forall\\vec a\\in A^n\\;\\left(\\mathfrak B\\models(\\exists x\\varphi)[\\vec a/\\vec y]\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[(\\langle a\\rangle\\frown\\vec a)/(\\langle x\\rangle\\frown\\vec y)]\\right)\\right]\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\preccurlyeq\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\langle x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{n+1}\\;\\left[|\\{x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\}|=n+1\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\left[\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,y_1,\\ldots,y_n\\}\\to\\forall\\vec a\\in A^n\\;\\left(\\mathfrak B\\models(\\exists x\\varphi)[\\vec a/\\vec y]\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[(\\langle a\\rangle\\frown\\vec a)/(\\langle x\\rangle\\frown\\vec y)]\\right)\\right]\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"6a7fe4775125052f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"90dc104b21b5c21e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$\\mathfrak A\\subseteq\\mathfrak B$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$。参数满足 $\\varphi[\\vec a/\\vec y]$ 取 [[57-df-satisfaction]] 的显式变量列接口；$\\preccurlyeq$ 取 [[57-df-elementary-substructure]]。","embed":false},{"t